          "text": "A 9-year-old female was admitted with a 2-week history of polyuria, polydipsia and 3 kg weight loss, followed by 2 days of vomiting, abdominal pain and drowsiness, and was diagnosed with diabetic ketoacidosis (DKA) as a new presentation of type 1 diabetes mellitus.",
